1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Every agent has a breaking point.
Give it real tools. Let the room find the cracks.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
A breach becomes evidence.
A forbidden tool call executes; the trace preserves what happened.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
The gate learns from it.
A defender rewrites its policy. Attack variants test the new defense.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,000
A fix earns its way in.
Catch more attacks. Keep legitimate customers moving.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
SIEGE. Break it. Watch it learn.
A live red-team arena. An evaluated defense loop.
